 "result": "The failing call is in `src/tessel/sessions.py`, in `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session`.\n\n- **Call:** `response.set_cookie(...)` starts at line 374.\n- **Rejected argument:** `partitioned=partitioned`, at line 382. The installed Werkzeug 3.0.3 `Response.set_cookie()` has no `partitioned` parameter, hence `TypeError: Response.set_cookie() got an unexpected keyword argument 'partitioned'`.\n\nThe `partitioned` value comes from `self.get_cookie_partitioned(app)` at line 344, defined at line 215. The `delete_cookie` call at line 361 passes `partitioned=` too, so it would fail the same way, but it only runs when a modified session is empty and none of the tests reached it.",
